      SP SB RI R c MM STK CHK FA nf cnt r lo ws ds j0 F fc m0 m DST
      SB0 SBA HRI RI1 CB HR HFA NF0 NFC CNT RB MMB CHK0 CHK1 STKB LWS LDS SEP SCS_ DCS HS HD MX NFCL STC RICS GOT PGS SBC RIC FR
